<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Rain</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Daju</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Rain</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5D50LQOoqYJxSLTC6xtAbK</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.009" end="00:15.327">I'm no good at goodbyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.327" end="00:19.120">But I'm leaving this last time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.120" end="00:21.219">I wish you the best and I guess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.219" end="00:23.080">I'll pretend this made sense</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.080" end="00:26.641">In my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.641" end="00:29.338">Why you wanna run away from that?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.338" end="00:30.838">You know all my flaws</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.298" end="00:33.809">Baby imma fall face down flat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.809" end="00:35.309">Gotta take it day to day like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.005" end="00:40.134">Tired of runnin' from it all like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.134" end="00:44.283">Would you care for me, yeah?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.283" end="00:46.524" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ohhhhh yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.524" end="00:48.351">Would you care for me, yeah?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.351" end="00:52.555">Would you care for me, uh?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.555" end="00:55.910">I just got used to the rain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.910" end="00:59.014">Your sunshine is filled with some grey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.014" end="01:02.119">There's so many hours in the day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.119" end="01:03.838">So stay here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.838" end="01:05.993">Just stay with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.993" end="01:09.053">I just got used to the rain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.053" end="01:12.634">Your sunshine is filled with some grey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.634" end="01:16.075">There's so many hours in the day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.075" end="01:17.666">So stay here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.666" end="01:21.655">Just stay with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.655" end="01:23.155">Loneliness is getting old</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.124" end="01:24.815" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(loneliness is getting old)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.815" end="01:28.307">Guess I'll reap what you sow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.307" end="01:31.187">Stayin silent while thinkin out loud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.187" end="01:33.145">Think twice before speakin and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.145" end="01:34.786">Make sure mama proud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.786" end="01:38.368">Raindrops fallin and fallin and fallin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.368" end="01:42.199">I still remember the taste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.199" end="01:43.955">Set my feelings aside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.955" end="01:45.777">This moment in time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.777" end="01:48.299">At the end of the day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.299" end="01:51.968">Would you care for me, yeah?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.968" end="01:54.228" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ohhhhh yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.228" end="01:56.163">Would you care for me, yeah?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.163" end="02:00.593">Would you care for me, uh?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.593" end="02:03.781">I just got used to the rain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.781" end="02:07.093">Your sunshine is filled with some grey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.093" end="02:10.509">There's so many hours in the day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.509" end="02:12.182">So stay here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.182" end="02:14.121">Just stay with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.121" end="02:17.302">I just got used to the rain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.302" end="02:20.704">Your sunshine is filled with some grey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.704" end="02:24.071">There's so many hours in the day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.071" end="02:25.681">So stay here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.681" end="02:29.681">Just stay with me</p></div></body></tt>